                "security-severity": "1.0"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Across 4 dependency manifests, QSI found crypto libraries (curve25519-dalek, ecdsa, ed25519-dalek, org.bouncycastle:bcprov-jdk18on, p256, p384, ring, rsa, rustls, secp256k1, x25519-dalek) but none from its PQC-capable list. Confirm where PQC support will come from (TLS terminator, KMS/HSM, library upgrade). Absence of evidence is not evidence of absence: system libraries and transitive dependencies may not be listed."
              },
